{#
  WiFi: inert informational text. Never a link, never a button, never a Web NFC call, never
  a connection attempt (FR-007, Principle IV, SC-007).

  The real connection is the tag's own "Wi-Fi Simple Config" NDEF record, written manually
  and out of scope for this repo. Only the network NAME is shown - business.json carries no
  WiFi password field, and none must ever be added here.

  Deliberately no <a>, no <button>, no tabindex, no role, and no event target: there is
  nothing on this element for a customer to activate.
#}
<li class="entries__item">
  <div class="entry entry--wifi">
    <span class="entry__label">{{ entry.label }}</span>
    <span class="entry__value">
      {%- if state == "confirmed" -%}
        {{ business.wifiSsid }}
      {%- else -%}
        {{ site.ui.pendingBadge }}
      {%- endif -%}
    </span>
  </div>
</li>
